      "name": "What is semi custom bedding?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Semi custom bedding is bedding or a blanket with a finished design that you personalize with your own text. In the Hobbies Bedding collection on Jeminise, every product offers two text input fields. You also choose the bedding type or material, the size and the pillowcase set."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does semi custom bedding cost at Jeminise?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Hobbies Bedding prices range from $24.90 to $154.90. Starting prices by type are $24.90 for fleece, $34.90 for a duvet cover, $39.90 for sherpa, $46.90 for a quilt and $64.90 for a comforter. The final price depends on the size and set you choose."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes does Hobbies Bedding come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Sizes include US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\") and US King (104\" x 88\"). There are also Twin (68\" x 86\"), Full (80\" x 90\"), Queen (90\" x 90\") and King (102\" x 91\"), plus metric sizes and blanket sizes from 40\" x 30\" up to a 60\" x 70\" throw. Some names have two measurements, so compare the inches with your mattress."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Hobbies Bedding machine washable?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "43 of the 47 Hobbies Bedding product pages state that the item is machine washable. Check for the \"Easy Care\" line on the page of the product you're ordering."
      }
    }
